kartoonikum-by-exhouseandnecrostudios (1.0+1-0ddebs9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches/07_use-system-headers-and-buildflags.patch : use the
    system OpenGL headers instead of the embedded 2007 copies, drop the
    unused libX11, use CPPFLAGS and CFLAGS so the hardening flags are
    really applied
  * debian/patches/08_vsync-and-event-loop.patch : enable V-Sync, handle
    every pending SDL event (the key code was read from an uninitialized
    event), quit/fullscreen keys on key press only
  * debian/control : build-depend on libgl-dev and libglu1-mesa-dev
    instead of mesa-common-dev, drop the useless dependency on
    common-install-function-ddebs, better description
  * debian/copyright : the upstream license is CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, not
    GPL-3+
  * debian/resources : desktop file with Keywords, add the missing icon
    (it was an empty file), from the Pouet screenshot
  * debian/*.6.md : complete credits and keys, regenerated man page
  * debian/*.lintian-overrides : override the pandoc groff-message false
    positive
  * removed debian/*-docs.docs, which pointed to a non-existent package

 -- Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:01:03 +0100

